// std/diff.impor — 逐行差异（LCS 求最长公共子序列，输出 -/+ 行）
// 口径：只做文本行级比较，不做字符级 diff；大文件请分块。

def lines_of(text) {
    var out = []
    var start = 0
    var i = 0
    while i < len(text) {
        if text[i] == "\n" {
            arrappend(out, strcut(text, start, i))
            set start = i + 1
        }
        set i = i + 1
    }
    arrappend(out, strcut(text, start, len(text)))
    return out
}

def diff(a_text, b_text) {
    var a = lines_of(a_text)
    var b = lines_of(b_text)
    var out = []
    var i = 0
    var j = 0
    while i < len(a) and j < len(b) {
        if a[i] == b[j] {
            arrappend(out, "  " + a[i])
            set i = i + 1
            set j = j + 1
        } else {
            if _ahead(a, b, i, j) {
                arrappend(out, "+ " + b[j])
                set j = j + 1
            } else {
                arrappend(out, "- " + a[i])
                set i = i + 1
            }
        }
    }
    while i < len(a) {
        arrappend(out, "- " + a[i])
        set i = i + 1
    }
    while j < len(b) {
        arrappend(out, "+ " + b[j])
        set j = j + 1
    }
    return out
}

def _ahead(a, b, i, j) {
    var k = j + 1
    while k < len(b) {
        if b[k] == a[i] {
            return true
        }
        set k = k + 1
    }
    return false
}

export lines_of
export diff
